 ],
 "title": "In a vertical lab, equipment is brought to the operator",
 "speed": 1.5,
 "camera": "wide",
 "phases": [
  {
   "start_frame": 0,
   "text": "A vertical lab: its storage brings each instrument to the operator, a mobile robot arm."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 27,
   "text": "Here it makes a charge for the atomizer. The VLM brings tray B, the powder doser, down."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 94,
   "text": "The arm stands an empty charge cup on the doser's shuttle, which carries it onto the balance."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 238,
   "text": "The doser weighs in the alloy's powders, one module at a time: 3.92 g of Si ..."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 323,
   "text": "... then 3.91 g of AlSi10Mg on top, for Al-10Si."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 408,
   "text": "The shuttle brings the charged cup out, and the arm stands it in the carrier on the robot."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 569,
   "text": "Tray B goes back into storage, and the robot takes the cup to the atomizer."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 657,
   "text": "At the atomizer, the arm pulls the lid's draw latch open and lifts the lid by its knob."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 807,
   "text": "With a loading tong, the arm takes the cup and sets it on the crucible's floor, past the sealing rod."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 1010,
   "text": "The arm shuts the lid and the latch, and the locking bolt goes in."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 1155,
   "text": "The atomizer melts the cup and sprays the melt into powder (a time-lapse, cut open)."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 1268,
   "text": "And the robot goes back to the VLM for the next tray."
  }
 ]
}
